[Music]  gentian impact is a massive game that on  its initial launch was truly magical  but i think i won't be alone here to say  that most people had a honeymoon phase  and the end game became the crossroads  for many players that's why when i got  to adventure rank 35  shortly after the release of the game i  completely fell off  with no new events at that time and  before the arrival of any new characters  that end game grind was brutal back then  and didn't have enough of a draw for me  to stay and complete even my dailies  but six months later picking up gentian  impact again turned out to be an  interesting experience because of its  unique combination of traits this game  has  so if like me you're considering playing  again then this might be the video for  you  if you'd like to see more genjin impact  content let us know by liking this video  so we can do more in the future  after not playing for six months i  started up genji impact again  and i initially felt indifferent to the  game at this point there have been a few  amount of updates added including a new  mounted area to explore and new primo  gem goals to hit as i continue playing  my feeling of fomo  or fear of missing out slowly started to  grow more and more which i guess comes  with the territory of any live service  game that you haven't played in a while  seeing everyone with their pet sealies  fully decked out team comps at level 90  and completed spiral abyss made me feel  a little more insecure about my current  setup  but having that goal in the back of my  mind after being away for so long  gave me some incentive to stick around  and put more hours back into the game  yes i'm still getting burnout from  farming the same places over and over  again  but this open world with all of its  beautiful vistas to this day is still  complete eye candy and hasn't lost its  charm  even pushing its limits can be kind of  fun specifically using wind elemental  resonance  a special five-star catalyst and mona  sprint her ground speed nears 200  and is so fast that the game can't even  keep loading up assets ahead of her  small things like this that people can  find depending on which characters they  have makes finding different  combinations and abilities a fun  experience  part of the appeal of this game is  obviously the characters and their  unique designs  and i think every anime fan can agree  that developer mihoyo designed some  really amazing characters  with the release of new and interesting  characters coming up fairly frequently  i'm confident that mihoyo won't have any  problems in the future coming up with  amazing ideas and characters  everyone is going to have different  experiences on how the game keeps them  engaged but for me specifically getting  tartaglia aka  child after having no main dps for my  entire time is a small push that made me  want to invest more time into it  finally coming up with the creative team  synergy that worked together well after  different combinations  turned out to be satisfying when i  figured it out because people are at  different levels and have different sets  of characters depending on how much time  and money they've invested i feel like  this tailor-made investment for me was  engaging and invited me to spend more  time with genjin  this does bring up a good point though  is gotcha still a bad mechanic  while it can turn out to be harmful in  under certain circumstances i think  genji's impact incorporated well enough  into the system of a pretty much tripoli  experience  that i feel like it's hard to judge it  from my perspective and rather it should  be judged by each person individually  what i will say is that having some  experience in the gotcha fields with  older games such as brave frontier and  final fantasy brave exodus when i return  to those games months later like i did  with genjin  i wasn't nearly as interested even  though i put a lot of time into those  games  they lasted about an hour on my phone  before i deleted them again which  definitely says something genji impact  stands out in that regard  and i enjoy enough to spend time with it  again and i'll be patiently waiting to  see the new map section that opens up  with the traveler's new element  and obviously the game's community  speaks for itself as well as it's one of  the biggest live service games still  standing next to other behemoths such as  fortnite apex legends and others  i think it's safe to say that i've got  my eye back on gadget impact  [Music]  you

